        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.93,
          "end": 35.433,
          "en": "and not too difficult.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.7,
          "end": 40.913,
          "en": "So how can you add buttons or elements to the header?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.8,
          "end": 44.78,
          "en": "Well, with the options that you can set on a screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.78,
          "end": 47.11,
          "en": "because there we configured other aspects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.11,
          "end": 48.21,
          "en": "of the header as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.21,
          "end": 51.38,
          "en": "Like for example, the title or the background color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.38,
          "end": 54.9,
