          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.96,
          "end": 59.1,
          "en": "let's for example say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.1,
          "end": 62.63,
          "en": "that's this screen here, the meal detail screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.63,
          "end": 66.43,
          "en": "And then there, we can add our screen specific options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.49,
          "end": 70.55,
          "en": "and we can add the header right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.55,
          "end": 72.91,
          "en": "or left option here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.91,
          "end": 75.58,
          "en": "And this allows us to add an element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.58,
          "end": 78.46000000000001,
          "en": "to the left or right of our title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.46000000000001,
          "end": 80.95,
          "en": "And here I'll choose header right.",
