          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.64,
          "end": 95.87,
          "en": "in a separate file, or you create a function in line here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.87,
          "end": 99.03999999999999,
          "en": "And what you should return in this function is JSX.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 99.03999999999999,
          "end": 101.84,
          "en": "Since again, the value for header right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.84,
          "end": 104.35300000000001,
          "en": "should be a component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.35300000000001,
          "end": 106.378,
          "en": "So here we can return JSX.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.378,
          "end": 107.211,
          "en": "And for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
